  "raw_answer": "To calculate \\( 23 \\times 17 \\), you can use the standard multiplication method:\n\n\\[\n23 \\times 17 = 23 \\times (10 + 7) = (23 \\times 10) + (23 \\times 7)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n23 \\times 10 = 230\n\\]\n\\[\n23 \\times 7 = 161\n\\]\n\nNow add them together:\n\n\\[\n230 + 161 = 391\n\\]\n\nSo, \\( 23 \\times 17 = 391 \\). ✅",
